{"rowNumber":368,"id":"su09_02h.ks#368","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ま、待った待った、水蓮姉……！！\nそんな汚い場所、ん、ぐぅっ、触っちゃ、ダメだって……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":373,"id":"su09_02h.ks#373","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「なら尚更、んちゅぁ、ちゅぷ……。触ってあげなくちゃ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":377,"id":"su09_02h.ks#377","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「身体の隅々まれ……んっ、んふぅ、れろろ。\n綺麗にしてあげりゅっへ、言ったれしょ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":381,"id":"su09_02h.ks#381","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"言いながら水蓮姉が肛門を優しく撫で続けてくれる。\n丹念に、丁寧に、力が入ったそこをほぐそうとするように。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":385,"id":"su09_02h.ks#385","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"何が何だかわからないが、身体は強張っているはずなのに、\n力が抜けていくような変な感覚に身体が支配されていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":389,"id":"su09_02h.ks#389","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"背筋をくすぐらせるような心地に全身がゾワゾワするが、\n何故か快感のようにも思える。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":401,"id":"su09_02h.ks#401","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふ……。お尻、んっ、んちゅぁ……湿ってきへりゅよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":405,"id":"su09_02h.ks#405","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お尻かりゃも、じゅぷぷっ、じゅるるっ……。\n溢れてくりゅんら？　おひんひんみたひに、えっちなお汁」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":409,"id":"su09_02h.ks#409","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"尿道から噴き出すカウパーを吸い出しながら、\n水蓮姉が嬉しそうな声を投げかけてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":413,"id":"su09_02h.ks#413","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"恐らく、未知の感覚への緊張から来る汗とか、腸液か何かだと思うんだけど、\nぼくには見えないし、肛門を撫で続けられ、すぐに言葉が出てこない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":418,"id":"su09_02h.ks#418","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「っ……！　く、ふ、うぅぅ……やっぱり、そんな場所触っちゃ――んんっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":422,"id":"su09_02h.ks#422","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私を気遣ってりゅなりゃ、れろろ……大丈夫だよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":426,"id":"su09_02h.ks#426","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私の指が汚れるって言うのなりゃ、ちゅぁむっ、んちゅぅ。\n後でちゃんと指を洗うかりゃ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":431,"id":"su09_02h.ks#431","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「だかりゃあなひゃは、れろろっ、ぺろ……。\n気持ちいいコトに集中……しへ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":436,"id":"su09_02h.ks#436","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「恥ずかしがらなくへも、んぁむ、んちゅぅ、れろろっ。大丈夫だかりゃ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":440,"id":"su09_02h.ks#440","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ひぁ……！　あっ……！　んんんっっ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":443,"id":"su09_02h.ks#443","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"恥ずかしがらなくても大丈夫なんて言われても、ある意味、\n性器より見せるのに抵抗がある場所を撫でられ、恥ずかしくないわけがない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":447,"id":"su09_02h.ks#447","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"しかしながら、性器への丁寧なフェラチオと肛門への愛撫が相まって、\n正直、反射的に飛び上がってしまうほどの気持ちよさがある。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":451,"id":"su09_02h.ks#451","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"肛門性交という言葉は知っていたが、まさか自分が\nこんな風にされる側になるなんて、思ってもいなかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":456,"id":"su09_02h.ks#456","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んんんっっ……！！　ふふふ、えっちなお汁の味、\nじゅるるっ、どんどん濃くなっへきてりゅ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":461,"id":"su09_02h.ks#461","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「おひんひんもお口の中れ震えっぱなひれ……はむぅぅ。\nしっかり咥えておかないひょ、口から飛び出ちゃいひょう」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":466,"id":"su09_02h.ks#466","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「そんなに、んちゅぁ……そんなにお尻が気持ちいいんだ？\nおひんひんの先っぽを舐める時よりビクビクしへりゅよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":471,"id":"su09_02h.ks#471","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「それは――んんっ……！！　そんなことはぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":474,"id":"su09_02h.ks#474","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"恥ずかしすぎて首をブンブンと横に振って答える。\nでも、恥ずかしいほどに上擦った声だけはどうにも誤魔化せなかった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":478,"id":"su09_02h.ks#478","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんなぼくの反応を見て気をよくしたのか、\n水蓮姉からかすかな笑みの音が聞こえてくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":483,"id":"su09_02h.ks#483","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふ……。なりゃ……こうしたりゃ、\nもっひょ気持ちいいの、かな……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":495,"id":"su09_02h.ks#495","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「お゛っ――！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":498,"id":"su09_02h.ks#498","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"肛内に異物感を覚えた瞬間――\n半ばえずいているような汚い声を発してしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":502,"id":"su09_02h.ks#502","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"入っている、指が……水蓮姉の指が、ぼくの肛門の中に。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":507,"id":"su09_02h.ks#507","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んふぅぅっ……！！　しゅごい、んんっ、感じかひゃ……！！\nえっちなお汁ドバドバでへ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":512,"id":"su09_02h.ks#512","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「やっぱり、んんっ、きもひいいんら？\nお尻のなきゃ、じゅるるるっ、ほじほじされりゅの」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":517,"id":"su09_02h.ks#517","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「おぐっ、うっ……抜いっ、抜いてっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":521,"id":"su09_02h.ks#521","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふ……らーめ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":525,"id":"su09_02h.ks#525","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「くぁぁぁ……！！！　ふぁ、あ゛ぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":528,"id":"su09_02h.ks#528","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の細い指がゆっくりと、労わるように優しく肛内に入ってくる。\n少しずつ、しかし確実に、ぼくの奥に入ってきている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":532,"id":"su09_02h.ks#532","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"最初に感じたのは異物感、次に感じたのは抵抗感と呼ぶべき\nどうにもならない感情だった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":536,"id":"su09_02h.ks#536","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"自分の身で体感して、初めて気付いた。身体の中に異物が入ってくることが、\nこんなに怖いものだったなんて。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":541,"id":"su09_02h.ks#541","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「怖がらなくへいいよ……？　んちゅぁ、じゅぷ、じゅぷぷ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":545,"id":"su09_02h.ks#545","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「すっ、水蓮、ねぇ……！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":548,"id":"su09_02h.ks#548","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"未知の快感と、その快感に怯え震えるぼくを励ますように、\n水蓮姉の口内がぼくのちんこを包み込み、ぼくの怯えごと吸い上げていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":553,"id":"su09_02h.ks#553","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「きもひいいコトだけに、んちゅぅ、ちゅぁむ、集中しへ……？\nそれ以外のコトは、ぺろろっ、れろ、考えなくへいいかりゃ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":558,"id":"su09_02h.ks#558","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あっ……！！　んぁぁぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":561,"id":"su09_02h.ks#561","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の優しい声と、卑猥なフェラチオの音がぼくの耳を撫で、\n肉棒に感じる確かな快感がぼくの中の恐怖心が和らげていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":566,"id":"su09_02h.ks#566","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふ、いい子いい子……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":570,"id":"su09_02h.ks#570","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「その調子れお姉ちゃんに全部任せへ……？\nもっひょ、んちゅぁ、気持ちよくしへあげりゅかりゃ……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":574,"id":"su09_02h.ks#574","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"一度快感側へ思考が傾くと、\n不思議と肛門に感じる異物感の捉え方にも変化が出始める。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":578,"id":"su09_02h.ks#578","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"自分で触れることのなかった確かな疼きが、\nじくじくとお腹の奥で息づきだしている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":583,"id":"su09_02h.ks#583","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……じゃあもう少し奥まれ、んん……、\n指挿れてみりゅね……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":587,"id":"su09_02h.ks#587","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もう少し奥までって――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":598,"id":"su09_02h.ks#598","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んふぅんっ……。んっ、ちゅぁ、んんっ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":602,"id":"su09_02h.ks#602","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「おおっ――ん、んんんっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":605,"id":"su09_02h.ks#605","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ヌプププ――と肛内に水蓮姉の指がより深く侵入してくる。\n全身に再び強い強張りが広がり、思わず息が止まってしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":609,"id":"su09_02h.ks#609","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"まるで射精した時のような火花が目の前で散った。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":613,"id":"su09_02h.ks#613","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んんっ……！！　ふふ、しゅごい感じかひゃ……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":617,"id":"su09_02h.ks#617","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お尻、ギュウギュウ締まっへ……。お姉ちゃんの指、んんっ、締め付けてる……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":621,"id":"su09_02h.ks#621","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「気を抜いたりゃ、んふぁ、んちゅぅ……！\n押し出されちゃいそうなくらい、ん、力こもって……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":625,"id":"su09_02h.ks#625","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"肛内に侵入してくる異物に対して、身体が反射的に押し出そうとする。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":628,"id":"su09_02h.ks#628","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"けれど、どれだけひりだそうとしても、\n水蓮姉の指はどんどん奥へと入ってくる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":632,"id":"su09_02h.ks#632","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"抵抗空しく犯されていくその感覚が、\nぼくの中の被虐的な部分に火をつけるようだった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":637,"id":"su09_02h.ks#637","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"深く入ってきた瞬間に触れた場所なんて――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":641,"id":"su09_02h.ks#641","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……ここ、でしょ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":645,"id":"su09_02h.ks#645","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「んああっっっ！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":648,"id":"su09_02h.ks#648","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そこを指で擦られた瞬間、再び目の前で火花が散った。\nどうして、ぼくの気持ちいい場所がわかったんだ──","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":653,"id":"su09_02h.ks#653","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「反応見てれば、んんっ、わかりゅよ？\nここに擦れひゃ時、んじゅるるっ、お汁溢れてくるかりゃ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":658,"id":"su09_02h.ks#658","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふふ……。もっひょ、ホジホジしてあげりゅ……ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":662,"id":"su09_02h.ks#662","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あ――あああああっ！！　そこ、は――ん゛ぁああああっっ！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":665,"id":"su09_02h.ks#665","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"言葉がない、とはこのことかもしれない。\n喉が詰まり、目の前は白くなり、たただた強烈な感覚が脳裏に焼きつく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":669,"id":"su09_02h.ks#669","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"膝と腰ががくがくと震え、ちんこが暴れるぐらいに\nドクドクと血流が送り込まれていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":673,"id":"su09_02h.ks#673","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"口から言葉すら出ないまま、堰を切ったように射精欲が暴れる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":676,"id":"su09_02h.ks#676","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"止めようのない生理現象のようなそれに、\n抗うことも、抑えることもぼくは出来なかった――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":693,"id":"su09_02h.ks#693","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あ゛ッ――あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛あ゛ッッ～～～！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":698,"id":"su09_02h.ks#698","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んんんんんんっっ！！？　――んごくっ！！\nじゅる、んん、ごく、ごく、ごく……じゅるる……ん、んん……！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":702,"id":"su09_02h.ks#702","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"一切の制御が出来ない、欲望が素通りで溢れるような射精だった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":705,"id":"su09_02h.ks#705","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そしてまるで水道管が破裂したかのように噴出し、止まらない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":709,"id":"su09_02h.ks#709","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「じゅ、じゅるる……ごく、ごく、ごくっ――んふぅん、んんっ……！！\nん、ごく、ごくっ……！！　んじゅるるるるるるっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":713,"id":"su09_02h.ks#713","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"次から次へと吐き出される精液が、水蓮姉に吸いだされていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":716,"id":"su09_02h.ks#716","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ぼくの精巣の中にある精液が、全部水蓮姉に飲まれていると感じる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":720,"id":"su09_02h.ks#720","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んん、じゅる、ごく、ごくっ――んぐっ。ぢゅるるるるるっっ！！\nごくくっ、ごくっ……！！　んじゅぅっ、じゅるぅぅっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":725,"id":"su09_02h.ks#725","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ああ、ああああっ……！！　はぁ、ああ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":728,"id":"su09_02h.ks#728","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"いやらしい嚥下音を鳴らしながら精液を飲み続ける水蓮姉、\n一方のぼくは目をかっぴらいたまま身を悶えさせ続けていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":732,"id":"su09_02h.ks#732","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"肛門の中で水蓮姉の指が動く度に、まるでスイッチでも押されているかのように、\n尿道から精液が飛び出していく。チカチカと目の前が点滅するほどの快楽だった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":739,"id":"su09_02h.ks#739","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「じゅるっ……！　じゅるるるる……！\nごくく……ごく……。ん……ふふ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":744,"id":"su09_02h.ks#744","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"飲み終わったのか、水蓮姉のかすかな笑いが耳に入る――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":754,"id":"su09_02h.ks#754","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「――あ゛あ゛っ！？　ぐ、んんっっーー！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":757,"id":"su09_02h.ks#757","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"気を抜きかけた瞬間――再び身体の中に電流のような快感が走る。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":762,"id":"su09_02h.ks#762","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んふふ……。んっ、んっ、んっ、んっ、んっ……！！\nじゅるるるっ、ぢゅるるるっ、じゅぶぶぶぶっっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":766,"id":"su09_02h.ks#766","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"多分、これが前立腺責めと噂に聞くものなのかもしれない。\nそこをいじられ、フェラされるとちんこの勃起が治まらない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":771,"id":"su09_02h.ks#771","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「や、やめ――あ゛ぁぁあっっ！！\n水蓮、姉っ……ちょっと、止め……あああっ……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":776,"id":"su09_02h.ks#776","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んちゅぁむっ……！！　んじゅぶぶっ、じゅぶじゅぼっ……！！\nれろれろれろっ……！！　んっ、ふっ、んんんっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":780,"id":"su09_02h.ks#780","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"息も絶え絶えに訴えるけれど姉さんは止まらない。\nこれ以上されたら頭がおかしくなりそうだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":784,"id":"su09_02h.ks#784","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"いや、しかし――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":789,"id":"su09_02h.ks#789","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ぢゅぶぶっ！！　じゅぶっ、じゅぼっ！！　んぢゅるるるっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":792,"id":"su09_02h.ks#792","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もしかしたら、水蓮姉はそのつもりなのかもしれない。\n何も考えられなくなるほど、おかしくなるほど、\nぼくを気持ちよくさせたいのかも。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":798,"id":"su09_02h.ks#798","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んふぅんっ！！　んっ、んっ、んっ、んっ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":802,"id":"su09_02h.ks#802","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「くはぁぁぁぁぁ……！！　あ゛っ、あ゛ぁぁぁぁ……！！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":805,"id":"su09_02h.ks#805","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"ドロドロの口腔でちんこを淫らにしゃぶられながら、\n前立腺をズリズリとやらしく擦られ続ける。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":809,"id":"su09_02h.ks#809","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"前と後ろの波状攻撃に、ぼくは抵抗すら出来ずに陥落している。\nぼくの口からは、壊れたような嬌声しか出てこない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":813,"id":"su09_02h.ks#813","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"まるでずっとイき続けているかのような気持ちよさ。\nずっとこんなのを味わっていたら、逝く気がする。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":818,"id":"su09_02h.ks#818","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ぢゅるるるるるるるるっっ！！　ぢゅるるるるっっ！！\nじゅるるるるるるるるるるるるるるるるっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":823,"id":"su09_02h.ks#823","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あ゛っ――あ゛ああああああっっ！！　あ゛あ゛あ゛あッッ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":826,"id":"su09_02h.ks#826","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そして、水蓮姉に一際強くちんこを吸われて、\n前立腺をぐにっと擦られた瞬間──","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":844,"id":"su09_02h.ks#844","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んぐっ――ん゛んんんんんんんんッッ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":847,"id":"su09_02h.ks#847","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の声音に、少し苦しげなものが混じっている。\n自分でもおかしいと思う量の精液が津波のように尿道から噴き出していた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":852,"id":"su09_02h.ks#852","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ご――ごくっ！　ごく、ごく、ごく――ん、んんんッッ！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":855,"id":"su09_02h.ks#855","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉がどんどん飲み込んでくれているが、\nそれ以上に噴出し続ける精液の量が多かった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":860,"id":"su09_02h.ks#860","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んぶっ――ん゛っ、んんんんんんッッ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":863,"id":"su09_02h.ks#863","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"このままじゃ水蓮姉が溺れてしまう、そう思った時、\n残った体の力を振り絞り、ぼくは腰を引いていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":884,"id":"su09_02h.ks#884","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「――ぷはっ……！！！　んぁっ、はぁああっっ～～……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":887,"id":"su09_02h.ks#887","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"かろうじて顔を背けて見てみれば、\n飛び出す白濁が水蓮姉の顔を真っ白に汚していた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":891,"id":"su09_02h.ks#891","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"けれど、水蓮姉はうっとりとした顔で精液を受け止めていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":895,"id":"su09_02h.ks#895","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁー、はぁー、はぁ……はぁー……！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":898,"id":"su09_02h.ks#898","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"一度目の射精で空っぽになったと思ってたのに、\nまさかここまで出るなんて……。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":902,"id":"su09_02h.ks#902","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"多分としかいいようがないが、暫定であの前立腺責めは本当にマズいと思う。\n快感の質が他とは全く違う。あんなの続けたら、あれじゃなきゃダメになりそう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":908,"id":"su09_02h.ks#908","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ……ふふ。もの凄い射精だったね？\nごめんね？　全部飲み干してあげられなくて」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":913,"id":"su09_02h.ks#913","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「ぼ、ぼくこそ、はぁ……はぁ……ごめん……！\nわけが、わからないくらい……気持ちよくって……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":920,"id":"su09_02h.ks#920","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「もー。謝らなくてもいいってば。\n気持ちよくなってくれればくれるほど私は嬉しいもん」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":924,"id":"su09_02h.ks#924","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"動いていないはずなのに、息が乱れ、呼吸がおぼつかない。\nそれに身じろぎすると、まだ肛内にある水蓮姉の指が擦れてしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":929,"id":"su09_02h.ks#929","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":933,"id":"su09_02h.ks#933","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「は、うぅぅっ！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":936,"id":"su09_02h.ks#936","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"微笑みの声を漏らした水蓮姉が、再び指を肛内でくねらせた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":940,"id":"su09_02h.ks#940","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「す、水蓮姉……！？　もういい、いいから……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":944,"id":"su09_02h.ks#944","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「遠慮しないで？　もっと気持ちよくしてあげるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":948,"id":"su09_02h.ks#948","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「いや、遠慮じゃない、って――はふぁっ！？　あふぅ……！！\nこれ以上されたら、変に、なる、から……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":953,"id":"su09_02h.ks#953","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「なっちゃっていいよ？　変になっちゃって？\nその方がきっと気持ちよくなれるよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":958,"id":"su09_02h.ks#958","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「大丈夫。変になってもお姉ちゃんがついてるから。\n安心して気持ちよくなってくれていいからね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":964,"id":"su09_02h.ks#964","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あまり刺激の強い場所ばかり触られるとつらいって言うなら、\nんっ、ふぁ、こんな風に――」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":968,"id":"su09_02h.ks#968","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の指が、ゆっくり肛内を出たり入ったりする。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":972,"id":"su09_02h.ks#972","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ。こんな風にじっくり慣らしながら気持ちよくしてあげる。\nこれなら感じすぎて辛くならないでしょ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":977,"id":"su09_02h.ks#977","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「た、確かに、ふおっ、そう、だけど……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":980,"id":"su09_02h.ks#980","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"さっきも思ったけど、あんまり肛門での快楽に慣れすぎたくないんだけど。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":983,"id":"su09_02h.ks#983","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"この快楽が当たり前になったら、自分でお尻を弄る羽目になりそうで――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":987,"id":"su09_02h.ks#987","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……心配要らないよ？\nそうなっちゃってもお姉ちゃんがお世話してあげるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":992,"id":"su09_02h.ks#992","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「だから気にせず、気持ちよくなっちゃっていいんだよ？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":995,"id":"su09_02h.ks#995","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉が優しく囁いてくる。\n囁きながら、指を肛門へぐいっと沈めてくる――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1000,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1000","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「かっ……！　あ゛ぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1003,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1003","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"身体がビクッと痙攣するように震える。\n水蓮姉の指先がもたらす快感に、いともたやすく操られてしまっている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1008,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1008","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ……。いいよ？　そのまま身を任せて……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1012,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1012","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「もっと受け入れて……？　自分の心に素直になって……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1016,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1016","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「怖がらなくていいから……。怖がる必要なんてないから……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1019,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1019","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"指がどんどん奥に入っていって、出したいのに入っていくという相反する感覚が、\n背徳的な官能をぼくにもたらしていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1024,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1024","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「それでいいんだよ……？　もっと力を抜いて……？\nお尻の中、クチュクチュしてあげるからね……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1028,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1028","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"水蓮姉の指が肛内で円を描くように動く。\n先ほどよりも優しく、ときどき前立腺に指が擦れる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1032,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1032","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"さっきまでつらいとすら感じていたものが、\n確かな快感として感じられてしまっている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1036,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1036","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"閃くように気付いた。今、ぼくは水蓮姉に開発されているんだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1040,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1040","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……。じゃあそろそろ、\n気持ちいい場所スリスリしてあげる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1045,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1045","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「一番感じちゃう場所……たくさんたくさん擦ってあげる……ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1048,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1048","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"もう止めようがないと思ったぼくは、その言葉を聞いて、\n身構えつつも、少しだけ……期待してしまっていた。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1053,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1053","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んふっ……んっ。ふふふ、スリスリ～……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1057,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1057","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あっ……！　あ゛ぁ……！！　ふぁぁあ゛ぁぁ――！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1060,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1060","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"条件反射のように、我ながらはしたない喘ぎ声が漏れる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1063,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1063","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"きっともう精管がバカになっているのかもしれない。\nだって、あれだけ出して、出切ったと思ったのにもう射精しそうな感じなんだ。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1070,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1070","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ、いいよ？　出して？　全部出しちゃって？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1074,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1074","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「お姉ちゃんの顔にかけちゃっていいから。\nううん、かけて？　お姉ちゃんの顔にかけて？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1079,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1079","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「知りたいの、はぁはぁ、あなたがどれくらい気持ちよくなって\nくれたのか。だから、はぁはぁ、だから……！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1083,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1083","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"優しくも有無を言わさぬように、ぼくを導く水蓮姉。\nズリズリと前立腺を擦られ、腰奥の疼きが激しくなっていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1087,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1087","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"気を抜くとかじゃなく、身体が勝手に射精の準備をしている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1091,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1091","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁ……！　出してっ？\nお姉ちゃんの顔っ、はぁはぁ、もっと真っ白にしてっ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1097,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1097","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「あなたの精子でっ、はぁはぁ……！！\n気持ちよくなってくれた証拠でっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1102,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1102","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「私の顔をドロドロにっ、はぁはぁ、真っ白にっっ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1107,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1107","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「たくさんかけてぇぇぇえええええっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1111,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1111","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「イ……く、うぅぅっ……！　あ゛、あ゛あ゛ぁぁ――！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1128,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1128","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んぁっ――あぁああんんっっ！！\nふぁぁぁぁあああああああっっ～～！！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1133,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1133","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「あ゛あ゛あ゛っ――あ゛ぁぁぁぁぁーー！！！？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1136,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1136","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"精子が噴き出す。どこに残ってたのかわからないほどの量の精液が溢れる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1139,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1139","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"フェラもされていないのに、肛門だけでこんなに出てしまうなんて。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1142,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1142","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"命をそのまま吐き出しているような射精は噴水のようだった。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1145,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1145","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"暴れるちんこから白濁が舞い上がり、\n水蓮姉にも、掃除した床にも飛び散っていく。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1159,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1159","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「んはぁ、はぁ、はぁ……！！　こんなに、はぁはぁ、いっぱい出て……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1163,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1163","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「まだこんなに、んちゅっ、たくさん残ってたんだ……？\n良かった、はぁはぁ、途中でやめないで……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1168,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1168","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「はぁはぁはぁ……！！　んぁぁぁ……！！」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1171,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1171","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"絶頂の余波が全身をガクつかせる。\n喉がひりつくほどに、からからに渇いている。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1177,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1177","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「慌てなくていいよ……？\nそのまま気持ちよくなり続けて……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1182,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1182","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「時間はたっぷりあるんだから……。\n余韻も全部、味わっていいんだよ……？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1186,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1186","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"余韻に悶え続けるぼくを、\n水蓮姉はそう言って受け入れてくれる。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1190,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1190","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"そんな心地よい水蓮姉の言葉と、全身の倦怠感と腰の虚脱感に、\nぼくは身を委ねてしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1194,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1194","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"正直動こうにも動けそうにない。そのぐらい、身体に力が入らない。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1198,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1198","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……嬉しい。とっても気持ちよさそうな顔してくれて……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1203,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1203","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「そのままゆっくり感じ続けてくれていいからね……？\n疲れちゃったのなら、そのまま倒れてきてもいいから……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1208,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1208","kind":"text","speaker":"名前","english":"","japanese":"「……水蓮、姉……」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1218,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1218","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"度重なる絶頂で体力を使い果たしてしまっていたのか、\n言われるがまま、体勢を変えた水蓮姉の身体に倒れ込んでしまう。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1223,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1223","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「ふふ……よしよし。眠っちゃっていいよ？\nお姉ちゃんがずっと抱きしめておいてあげるから」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1227,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1227","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"身体がそっと優しく抱きしめられる。\n柔らかく温かい肌の感触がとても心地良い。","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1232,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1232","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「今は眠って……？　気持ちいい気分のまま……ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1236,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1236","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「目が覚めたらまたお世話してあげるから。\n汗だくになった身体を綺麗にしてあげる」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1241,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1241","kind":"text","speaker":"水蓮","english":"","japanese":"「……ふふ。身体の隅々まで、ね？」","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1244,"id":"su09_02h.ks#1244","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"","japanese":"夢か現かの狭間で、ぼくはそんな水蓮姉の囁きを聞いたような気がした――","korean":"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
